# Path-only rules (Pages cannot match the host or the query string).
# Every target is a single hop to a 200 page in its canonical form
# (kervanbreaker.com pages other than home have no trailing slash).
# There is no SPA fallback: unknown paths get dist/404.html with HTTP 404.

# Eski kırıcı ürün sayfaları → kervanbreaker.com ürün sayfaları
/keski                  https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler/keski        301
/piston                 https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler/piston       301
