/kit                    https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler/tamir-kiti   301
/wedge                  https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler/kama         301
/lower-housing          https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler/alt-govde    301
/stud                   https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler/saplama      301

# Eski legacy HTML sayfaları
/catalog                https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler              301
/catalog.html           https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler              301
/part                   https://kervanbreaker.com/urunler              301
